{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Use it to summon the ravenous one, and the greedy one.  They could replace the ravens, or they could open the way to the Dragon Nidhogg to retrieve them and bring them back to this world. Beware. A death in Niflehl is not one that can ever be brought back from that place.\nOr you your selves may wield it as ceremonial ravens. As priestess you can represent their ideal, though none of their power to undo death or answer questions would be given unto you.","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:36:09.036000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-24T06:47:10.859000Z","id":"868381020540518410","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"What would our duties be then?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:36:59.862000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868381233720217600","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"To do as the Ravens would do.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:37:13.882000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868381292524367872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
