{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Irynx nods, a little too desperate of a motion, and her ravens fly up to perch on her shoulders again. She folds her hands over Willow's on the spear. \"Thought and Memory.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:38:08.053000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868381519733997578","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"How... how can we be ceremonial ravens if we can't do all that they could?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:39:18.246000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868381814144786462","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The green man does not answer","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:39:37.113000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868381893278728223","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Would we need to stay here? In the grove?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:40:14.088000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868382048363118592","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
