{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Apgan and Nolan will arrive together, holding lamp-lighting wicks.","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:41:37.735000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868382399204032522","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"He's not the one who answers the questions, Willow.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:41:58.869000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868382487846453298","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I...\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:42:13.834000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868382550614216725","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Priestesses.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:42:33.709000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868382633976037456","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Lamplighters.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:43:00.859000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868382747851390986","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Irynx turns, and smiles. \"Good to see you have your mind again.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:43:29.418000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868382867636498533","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I would wish it otherwise, knowing the cost, but I suppose that it was none of our choices.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:44:13.457000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868383052349460490","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Thank you for the kind words.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:44:28.174000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868383114077012008","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"*Willow and Irynx are holding the spear together*","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:44:30.492000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868383123799433266","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"The twins wanted the city to have its lamplighters.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:45:04.220000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868383265264926730","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"“And priest-ess-es.”","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:45:22.076000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868383340158414869","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"We are going to have to work together.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:45:52.448000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868383467547803678","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"And they were never much to explain themselves. So if the lamplighters meant so much to the twins, then I imagine you two should mean something to us.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:46:05.180000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868383520949669908","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Willow has put it better than I could.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:46:20.626000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868383585734889533","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"“We pro-tect this place. Strong-er as u-ni-ted front.”","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:46:53.866000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868383725153554442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"We represent care for the city. The lamplighters, to keep it from falling to the noir. And us, to keep it from falling to itself.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:47:42.134000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868383927604248617","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Willow nods.","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:48:31.013000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868384132617621504","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Well Sarge, I suppose we should share what we know about Kingsbridge with these two.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:49:05.763000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868384278369669180","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"“Can we… make them lamp-light-ers? Would be eas-i-er that way. Can have desks and shared space.”","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:49:54.909000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868384484502933524","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I think that's up to the lamplighter offices. And to them.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:50:32.514000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868384642229755995","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"“I do not wish to…. re-move i-den-ti-ties like the ravens did… Per-haps… as con-sul-tants? I wish you to have… acc-ess to… the re-cords.”","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:51:57.272000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868384997730549780","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"That could work.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:52:16.801000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868385079641112628","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Willow and Irynx, consulting lamplighters.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:52:39.313000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-24T06:52:44.069000Z","id":"868385174063288340","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"And apparently ceremonial ravens.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:53:03.166000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868385274110017536","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"“Con-sul-ting ravens… ev-en better.”","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:53:25.300000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868385366946775051","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"We won't be able to do much that the twins could do. But protecting Empire City.... that's not going to stop.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:54:28.921000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868385633792565248","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Let me tell you about the current threats we know about. The Clutter's murderer or murderers are still unknown. Buchanan, the former head of the lamplighters was corrupt and involved in a criminal conspiracy, and was a British spy. Violet, former bartender of the Umbral Cup is strongly suspected of amassing a collection of body parts in her inn, possibly of those who stayed in the Umbral Cup. And the threat of the noir remains.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:55:25.236000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868385869994790952","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Nolan bows his head. “I do wish… to apol-o-gize. I did not un-der-stand what would be tra-ded. I am so-rry for your loss. And the cit-y’s.”","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:55:43.152000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-24T06:56:02.956000Z","id":"868385945139961866","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Speaking of the threat of the noir...would you three like to journey out there for a little reconnaissance tonight?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:57:44.446000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868386453883875328","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"(I am so sorry but it is 3am)","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:58:35.941000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868386669869563945","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"(Same)","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:58:52.453000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868386739125907478","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"It is getting late. I am tired.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:59:32.683000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868386907862741002","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"“To-mor-row… to much to-night. We all must rest.”","created_at":"2021-07-24T06:59:34.632000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868386916037459968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"As you wish. I will try to organize a party all the same. I hope this is acceptable.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:00:05.472000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868387045389783120","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I don't like today,\" she mutters. \"I'm... not in the right mindset to do anything. Sorry.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:00:43.588000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868387205259870228","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"But Willow, if you can, since you're the druid. What can we do about the tree?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:00:49.085000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-24T07:00:54.883000Z","id":"868387228315971614","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
