{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Orphy and Eurus find their own branches on the dying willow and watch over the two priestesses.","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:05:48.630000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868388484698738709","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"I enter the scene surprised to see anyone at all. \"Oh. Oh! Am I - I came to see - should I go?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:07:14.402000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868388844452581396","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"No, stay, you need to know.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:07:49.136000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868388990137565215","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"That sounds . . . Dire?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:08:56.521000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868389272770719785","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"The twins have passed from this Earth.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:09:34.713000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868389432959598642","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Whatever you needed from them, please refer to their priestesses, Irynx and Willow.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:10:01.689000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868389546105143346","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"(Do you look the same? Wintergreen still has nightmares of your death)\n\n\"They've gone to some other realm on the world tree? Planar travel, I speculate.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:11:37.850000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868389949433577562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I can talk. Not quite that tired.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:11:40.469000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868389960418480128","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"(I still look the same)","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:11:57.492000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868390031818117150","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"They're dead Wintergreen.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:12:08.507000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868390078018383922","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Just.... don't expect me to be running around next to you,\" she jokes.","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:12:16.527000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868390111656697917","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"They've shuffled off this mortal coil.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:12:21.887000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868390134138159124","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"There is a way to bring them back. But it will not be safe, or pleasant, I imagine.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:13:05.966000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868390319018897439","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"I turn pale. \"So, did you? Surely as powerful as they? If you - They can . . . \"\nI fixate on what Irynx is saying. \"Planar travel!\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:13:39.902000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868390461356777522","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Uh, yes, I imagine it would be planar travel.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:13:58.394000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868390538917847110","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Of course. It is only logical.\" The thought seems to normalize the idea for me.","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:14:30.665000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868390674272227388","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"For the time being, they won't be here. Not until they are retrieved, and only at great risk.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:14:30.747000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868390674616160326","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"That great risk involves a dragon, and there is no bringing you back if you fall.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:15:08.749000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868390834008113172","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Wintergreen, would you be willing to journey into the noir with me? I'm trying to form a party to help protect Kingsbridge tonight.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:16:41.222000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868391221867970560","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"This City is full of heroes! I have no doubt the ravens will return. I will reserve my inquiry until then. Incidentally would the dragon be of the brick variety I witnessed on the docks? Such a unique creature.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:16:54.308000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868391276754649139","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"(I have to get some rest, I'm only good for maybe 30 minutes or so)","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:17:34.879000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868391446921760798","reply_to_id":"868391221867970560","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Then I must take my leave.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:17:48.471000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868391503930724422","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Unfortunately I must decline, good sir, but I will join you another night.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:18:02.877000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868391564353884201","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Uh. No. More of a mythical dragon, rather than bricks. Nidhogg.\" Then she turns to Apgan. \"I suggest you find the nameless. He'd be in Ferrytown searching for a deck of tarot cards. He's been raring to go back into the Noir.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:18:03.319000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-24T07:18:33.232000Z","id":"868391566207778836","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Thank you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:18:19.366000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868391633513754644","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Nidhogg root-gnawer? Fascinating indeed. Tell me priestesses, would it be acceptable for me to rest here tonight? If I cannot have the council of the ravens, perhaps it will ease my mind to be close to this holy place.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:23:11.308000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868392858007269377","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"(Also is it disrespectful to do my essence search here?)","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:25:39.061000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868393477728256042","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"You can have my counsel, if you'd like,\" she smiles. \"Willow will be resting. It's been a horrible day.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T07:27:23.253000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868393914741194812","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
